        "title": "Count cattle with 头",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Put 头 between a number and 牛 when counting cattle. Once the animal is clear, the noun may be omitted: 三头 still means three cattle in this context. Do not add 个 as another classifier.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "前面有三头牛，后面有两头。",
                "pinyin": "qiánmiàn yǒu sān tóu niú ， hòumiàn yǒu liǎng tóu 。",
                "meaning": "There are three cattle in front and two behind.",
